  "meta": {},
  "name": "Automatically Check Missing Client Documents in Google Drive and Send Chatwork Reminders",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5870a3ea-81da-44be-b0ac-75d0be696a06",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        432,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Automatically Check Missing Client Documents in Google Drive and Send Chatwork Reminders\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs on a monthly schedule to identify clients who are missing required documents for the previous month. It reads the client list from Google Sheets, skips clients who have already been reminded, then loops through each eligible client to inspect their Google Drive monthly folders and required subfolders. When missing documents are found, it sends a Chatwork reminder and updates the client\u2019s last reminder date in Google Sheets before continuing the loop.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Schedule Trigger with the desired monthly run date and time.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and set the spreadsheet/range containing client records, reminder dates, and any required identifiers such as client folder IDs or names.\n- Connect Google Drive credentials for the folder lookup nodes and ensure the workflow account has access to all client document folders.\n- Configure the Google Drive API HTTP request authentication, query parameters, and file search criteria so it can check the expected files in each required folder.\n- Connect Chatwork credentials and set the target room, message format, and recipient information for reminders.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the code nodes to change the previous-month calculation, required folder names, document rules, and reminder message content. You can also modify the skip condition to change how often clients may receive reminders."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2e2007a7-6382-4aa4-a392-ac694178f876",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        992,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 448,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Schedule month check\n\nStarts the workflow on a monthly schedule and calculates the previous month that should be checked for missing client documents."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
